title: 'network/litep2p: replay identified peers to a new event stream'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    With the litep2p backend, an event stream now receives a `PeerIdentified` for every connected
    peer identified before it subscribed. A subscriber created after the network starts, such as the
    statement handler, no longer misses the peers that connected and identified in between.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: patch
